// AWS EC2 Instance Connect SSH Key Pushed  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1021.007
// Detects pushing a temporary SSH public key to an instance via EC2 Instance Connect (SendSSHPublicKey), enabling SSH access for lateral…
// False positives: Administrators using EC2 Instance Connect for legitimate access.
